Query 6: Write a query that reports the following:
- Films that have (trailers OR behind the scenes) special features but 
  NOT commentaries (keep in mind films that have both trailers and behind 
  the scenes special features might also have other features)
- Sort by title
- Note: to thoroughly test, temporarily commend out the WHERE clause
******************************************************************************************************************\
SELECT title, release_year, rating, special_features
FROM film
WHERE (special_features LIKE '%Trailers%'
    OR special_features LIKE '%Behind the Scenes%')
    AND special_features NOT LIKE '%Commentaries%'
ORDER BY title;





